<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian February inflation flat at 8.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenian February inflation flat at 8.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)		 Feb	Jan	Feb96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change		0.4	1.1	 0.9</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		  8.5	9.0	 8.5</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
